  "description": "The Redshift storage configuration identified by UUID\u202f123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000 is named **production_redshift**. It connects to the Redshift cluster at **redshift-cluster.company.com**, targeting the **analytics** database on port\u202f5439 with SSL mode set to **REQUIRE**. The connection uses the **public** schema and authenticates with the username **redshift_user**; the password is securely stored in EC2 Parameter Store under the key **/prod/redshift/password**. This setup permits a maximum of **100** error events, processes up to **5,000,000** rows per batch, and operates under the IAM role **arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/RedshiftAccessRole** for the purpose **ENRICHED_EVENTS**.  \n\nTo reach the cluster from our private network we employ an SSH tunnel. The bastion host **bastion.mycompany.com** listens on port\u202f22 and is accessed with the user **ec2-user**; the SSH private key is retrieved from EC2 Parameter Store using the parameter **/prod/ssh/key**, with an optional passphrase **optionalPassphrase**. Traffic is forwarded to the destination **redshift-cluster.company.com** on port\u202f5439, while the local side of the tunnel is bound to port\u202f5432.",
  "reference_json": {
    "id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
    "name": "production_redshift",
    "host": "redshift-cluster.company.com",
    "database": "analytics",
    "port": 5439,
    "sslMode": "REQUIRE",
    "schema": "public",
    "username": "redshift_user",
    "password": {
      "ec2ParameterStore": {
        "parameterName": "/prod/redshift/password"
      }
    },
    "maxError": 100,
    "compRows": 5000000,
    "roleArn": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/RedshiftAccessRole",
    "purpose": "ENRICHED_EVENTS",
    "sshTunnel": {
      "bastion": {
        "host": "bastion.mycompany.com",
        "port": 22,
        "user": "ec2-user",
        "key": {
          "ec2ParameterStore": {
            "parameterName": "/prod/ssh/key"
          }
        },
        "passphrase": "optionalPassphrase"
      },
      "destination": {
        "host": "redshift-cluster.company.com",
        "port": 5439
      },
      "localPort": 5432
    }
  }
